cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use disappR, please cite the software and the paper."
title: "disappR: a shiny app to model ageing and selective [dis]appearance"
abstract: "A Shiny workflow for longitudinal ageing data that follows a visual-first diagnosis of selective disappearance and selective appearance, then fits and compares ten comparative mixed models."
